            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "7.28%！美國房貸創近3年新高 購屋族每月多付276美元",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c6bf21441544d7c08174d203b751fa454753674ed6a03918847297b2f4028ad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd89ec956a5cc38da20689cb67a59a963.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
